{
  "cited_article_id": "configure-critical-lab-alerts",
  "reply": "To set up critical lab alerts, go to Clinical > Lab Settings > Critical Alerts, click Add Rule, choose the lab test, enter the low and high threshold values, check Instant Staff Notification, assign the alert to the appropriate role or provider queue, and then Save Rule. Ensure staff have the Manage Lab Settings permission and that notifications are enabled in My Profile > Notifications."
}
